  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Consortium is assisting both population with emergency intervention in acute nutrition crisis and address consequences of nutrition crisis in areas identified by the consortium where a multi- year approach could improve the nutrition and health status of under 5 children and pregnant and lactating women.</narrative>
